story.summaryEn:
From the cloud to the track.
@JensonButton and Commercial Technology Ambassador Eric Ernst joined @CoreWeave in San Francisco for Fully Connected, exploring how enterprise AI is transforming the way we compete in Formula One.
From trackside insights to race-weekend decisions, discover the technology powering performance.

detailZh:
从云端到赛道。
@JensonButton 和商业技术大使 Eric Ernst 加入 @CoreWeave 在旧金山Fully Connected活动中，探讨了企业AI如何改变我们参与一级方程式的竞争方式。
从赛道洞察到周末决策，发现推动性能的技术。

